        "epoch": 1,
        "hypothesis": "For grids with enough rows to amortize OpenMP overhead, static row scheduling should parallelize stencil updates and copying across the available cores. An integer OR reduction preserves the convergence flag, while the update-loop barrier ensures the copy pass sees complete results.",
        "id": "11ce495741b04b02",
        "ordinal": 2,
        "parent_id": null,
        "role": "C",
        "source_commits": [],
        "sources": [],
        "transformations": {
          "files": [
            "src/laplace_seq.c"
          ],
          "retained": [
            "Add OpenMP static worksharing for both interior-row passes, with the implicit barrier between stencil updates and copying.",
            "Reduce the convergence flag with bitwise OR across threads.",
            "Use an OpenMP if clause to serialize work for grids smaller than 64 rows and avoid parallel team overhead on small inputs."
          ]
        },
